		{
			"id": 7410025,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7410003",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7410003,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"阿尔",
					"小卷心菜"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741002501,
					"content": "如果能够重新取回莉利丝公主的宝物，正义阵营的势力也将随着那份「时间」变得壮大，击败「纳西索斯」的胜利日就在眼前！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741002502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 741002502,
					"content": "…为此我们也绝不能遗忘奈伊的牺牲，如果没有他藏起宝物，「纳西索斯」必然早已攻破了公主所在的高塔。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741002503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 741002503,
					"content": "嗯，奈伊哥哥很了不起。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741002504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小卷心菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 741002504,
					"content": "#我们不能辜负奈伊的努力，也不能辜负{NICKNAME}的努力，这次，有大家的帮忙，我们一定能救出莉利丝公主。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741002505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 741002505,
					"content": "对，救出莉利丝公主，然后，然后…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741002506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小卷心菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 741002506,
					"content": "然后水仙十字王国就能恢复以前那样粼光闪耀的样子，公主又能将你抱在怀中，为你整理羽毛，轻轻抚摸你小小的额头。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741002507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 741002507,
					"content": "那些遗失在水畔的回忆将重新归来，所有的朋友们都欢笑着围绕在公主身边，一切总会变成幸福美满的样子，再无纷争与烦恼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741002508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 741002508,
					"content": "就跟以前一样！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741002509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小卷心菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 741002509,
					"content": "…对，就跟以前一样。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "阿尔"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7410026,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
